{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"15cf4962220790a4da9d22a145b019d10740b926b3bbffa17ac7fa7978ccb19d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗受罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西娶了古实女子为妻。米利暗和亚伦因他所娶的古实女子就毁谤他，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「难道耶和华单与摩西说话，不也与我们说话吗？」这话耶和华听见了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["摩西为人极其谦和，胜过世上的众人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华忽然对摩西、亚伦、米利暗说：「你们三个人都出来，到会幕这里。」他们三个人就出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华在云柱中降临，站在会幕门口，召亚伦和米利暗，二人就出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：「你们且听我的话：你们中间若有先知，我—耶和华必在异象中向他显现，在梦中与他说话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我的仆人摩西不是这样；他是在我全家尽忠的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我要与他面对面说话，乃是明说，不用谜语，并且他必见我的形象。你们毁谤我的仆人摩西，为何不惧怕呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华就向他们二人发怒而去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["云彩从会幕上挪开了，不料，米利暗长了大麻风，有雪那样白。亚伦一看米利暗长了大麻风，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["就对摩西说：「我主啊，求你不要因我们愚昧犯罪，便将这罪加在我们身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["求你不要使她像那出母腹、肉已半烂的死胎。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["于是摩西哀求耶和华说：「 神啊，求你医治她！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：「她父亲若吐唾沫在她脸上，她岂不蒙羞七天吗？现在要把她在营外关锁七天，然后才可以领她进来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["于是米利暗关锁在营外七天。百姓没有行路，直等到把米利暗领进来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["以后百姓从哈洗录起行，在巴兰的旷野安营。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}